Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.44,0:00:27.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ What I feel ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.44,0:00:26.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}《克拉克森的农场》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.12,0:00:28.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（第五季）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.08,0:00:30.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ I can't say ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.24,0:00:37.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ But my love is there for you anytime of day ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.88,0:00:42.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ But if it's not love ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.60,0:00:45.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ That you need ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.36,0:00:51.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Then I'll try my best to make everything succeed ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.08,0:00:55.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}大概是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.52,0:00:57.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Tell me, what is my life without your love? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.52,0:00:57.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（北区 收到 上校）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.80,0:01:07.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ And tell me who am I without you? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.80,0:01:07.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}《第三十三集 手术中》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.28,0:01:10.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Have all the numbers arrived yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.28,0:01:10.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所有桌号的都到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.80,0:01:16.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, Bee Juice Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.80,0:01:16.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好 蜂汁蜂蜜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.56,0:01:20.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Welcome back to Clarkson's Farm,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.56,0:01:20.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}欢迎回到《克拉克森的农场》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.96,0:01:24.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}where everything is as we left it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.96,0:01:24.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一切都和我们离开时一样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.56,0:01:26.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（哨兵急救车）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.52,0:01:28.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Nearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.52,0:01:28.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}差不多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.32,0:01:42.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（牛津心脏中心 一层 - 心脏科 - 仅血管造影室）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.20,0:01:44.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's gonna stay there for a couple of hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.20,0:01:44.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它要在那儿待几个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.84,0:01:46.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Which one? - This one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.84,0:01:46.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 哪一根？这根吗？ - 这根 对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.84,0:01:49.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.84,0:01:49.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那么…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.72,0:01:54.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}yeah, in a couple of hours, we'll take it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.72,0:01:54.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 过几个小时我们就把它摘掉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:02:00.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A few weeks earlier, I'd tried to open my pub
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:01:57.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（农夫的狗）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.24,0:02:00.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}几周前 我一边忙着开酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.64,0:02:03.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}while simultaneously doing the harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.64,0:02:03.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一边还要收庄稼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.88,0:02:06.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Power cut, fans are dead, no gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.88,0:02:06.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}停电了 风扇不转 没煤气
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.28,0:02:11.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fuck, fuck, fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.28,0:02:11.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.40,0:02:12.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fucking piece of...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.40,0:02:12.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我真是服了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.76,0:02:17.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it had all been a bit too stressful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.76,0:02:17.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那段时间压力有点太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.28,0:02:30.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- All right, mate? - Oh, you're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.28,0:02:30.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还好吗 兄弟？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.84,0:02:33.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I'm back and not dead. - How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.84,0:02:31.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:33.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我回来了 还没死
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.32,0:02:35.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The Reaper will have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.32,0:02:34.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.32,0:02:35.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}死神还得再等等
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.00,0:02:38.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It was fucking close, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.00,0:02:38.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过真的很悬
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.56,0:02:40.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Cor, you did look ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.56,0:02:40.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪 你当时看着病得不轻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.04,0:02:43.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was worried, I have been worried. I've been properly worried actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.04,0:02:43.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我当时很担心 一直都担心坏了 其实真的特别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.52,0:02:46.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's good to see you. What did they say?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.52,0:02:46.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}见到你真好 兄弟 他们怎么说？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:47.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It wasn't a heart attack. - Okay, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:47.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不是心脏病发作
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.64,0:02:50.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What did the tingling in the arm mean, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.64,0:02:49.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那好 是好事 - 但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:51.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那手臂发麻是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.44,0:02:53.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That was just coincidental. I was scrolling on my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.44,0:02:53.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那只是碰巧 如果我没有…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.80,0:02:55.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.80,0:02:55.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我当时在刷手机 - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.92,0:02:57.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If I hadn't have been doing that,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.92,0:02:59.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我没有刷手机 我手臂就不会发麻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.12,0:02:58.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I wouldn't have got pins and needles in my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.00,0:03:00.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And if I hadn't have got pins and needles, I wouldn't have thought:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.00,0:03:00.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我没有手臂发麻 我就不会想
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.80,0:03:02.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Hang on, am I having a heart problem?"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.80,0:03:02.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-“等等 我心脏是不是出问题了” - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.92,0:03:04.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I wouldn't have gone to hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.92,0:03:04.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我就不会去医院了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.40,0:03:08.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Anyway, they put me in this, like, big Polo ring
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.40,0:03:08.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}总之 他们让我躺进一个 像大号薄荷糖一样的机器里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.68,0:03:12.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and they found I've got really bad coronary artery problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.68,0:03:12.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}结果发现我的冠状动脉问题非常严重
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.16,0:03:15.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So you've got three arteries... - Coming out the heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.16,0:03:15.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以他们…你有三根动脉… - 是从心脏出来的那种吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.72,0:03:18.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, that feed your heart with blood to keep it pumping.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.72,0:03:18.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不是 是给心脏供血 让它保持跳动的那几根
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.36,0:03:20.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}One of them, totally blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.36,0:03:20.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}其中一根完全堵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.48,0:03:22.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}One of them looked like something dangling from the roof of a cave
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.48,0:03:22.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一根看起来像峰区岩洞里顶上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.44,0:03:25.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}in the Peak District.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.44,0:03:25.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}垂下来的那种石笋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.20,0:03:29.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And one of them had got so clogged up it had had to form, like, branches.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.20,0:03:29.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有一根堵得太严重 不得不长出像分支一样的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.76,0:03:31.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So my heart wasn't getting any blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.76,0:03:31.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我的心脏就得不到供血
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.88,0:03:33.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I said:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.88,0:03:36.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我问：“我离心脏病发作还有多远？”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.28,0:03:36.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"How close was I to a heart attack?"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.44,0:03:38.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And he went: "Days?"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.44,0:03:38.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他回答：“几天”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.36,0:03:40.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.36,0:03:40.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.28,0:03:42.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They put a camera up my arm
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.28,0:03:44.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们把一个摄像头从我的手臂伸进去 穿过胸口 一直进到心脏里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.64,0:03:44.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and it crossed my chest and into my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.20,0:03:46.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Could you feel it? - Yeah, you can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.20,0:03:46.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你能感觉到吗？ - 能 能感觉到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.48,0:03:48.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And you can see your own heart on a TV screen. Then they put...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.48,0:03:48.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以在电视屏幕上看到自己的心脏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.80,0:03:52.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because they were gonna have to do open-heart surgery, they thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.80,0:03:52.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后他们放… 因为他们本来是要做开胸手术的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.92,0:03:54.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.92,0:03:54.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他们当时是那么想的… - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.64,0:03:57.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Then they went up and they realised they could actually mend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.64,0:03:57.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}结果他们伸进去之后 发现其实可以直接修复
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:03:59.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So they got the Dyno-Rod out, shoved that in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:03:59.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}于是他们就把疏通器拿出来了 塞了进去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.92,0:04:01.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- "Dyno-Rod"! - Well, it was!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.92,0:04:01.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 疏通器 - 还真是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.88,0:04:05.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And they had, like, hammers, chisels, cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.88,0:04:05.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们还用了锤子、凿子 摄像头之类的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.36,0:04:08.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then they put, like, the stents, which are Brillo pads, in,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.36,0:04:07.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后他们放了支架
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.28,0:04:08.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 就像钢丝球一样… - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.44,0:04:11.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to stretch it out. So I should be as good as new.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.44,0:04:11.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…把它撑开 所以我应该恢复如初了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.16,0:04:13.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh good. So what have they said, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.16,0:04:15.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 太好了 那他们后面怎么说？ - 一周不能开车
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.80,0:04:15.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can't drive for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.96,0:04:17.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.96,0:04:17.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.16,0:04:18.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.16,0:04:20.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有…不能做任何体力活
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.88,0:04:20.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}no manual labour of any sort,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.72,0:04:23.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can't stretch myself, for six weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.72,0:04:23.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}六周内不能做拉伸动作
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.36,0:04:24.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Six weeks? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.36,0:04:24.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 六周？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.52,0:04:26.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So no on the farm really, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.52,0:04:26.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那你基本上就没法在农场干活了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.04,0:04:27.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Cause, I mean, everything on the farm... - No, no, I know. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.04,0:04:27.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}农场里全是体力活
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.80,0:04:31.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I can't move, I can't do anything. - Oh, that's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.80,0:04:29.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊 我知道 我动不了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.92,0:04:31.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么都干不了 - 那太遗憾了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.80,0:04:34.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.80,0:04:34.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.96,0:04:37.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm, I'm gonna see Lisa. Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.96,0:04:37.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我要去见丽莎了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.08,0:04:39.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. I'm gonna just feed the cows and bed 'em up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.08,0:04:39.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好 我去喂一下牛 给它们铺好褥草
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.12,0:04:40.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All right, see you in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.12,0:04:40.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}行 一会儿见
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.40,0:04:45.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I wasn't the only one who'd been in the wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.40,0:04:45.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不只是我一个人遭了殃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.72,0:04:47.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Poor old Sansa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.72,0:04:47.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可怜的珊莎…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.60,0:04:50.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Got pyometra at the weekend
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.60,0:04:50.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}周末得了子宫蓄脓
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.12,0:04:53.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and had to have an emergency hysterectomy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.12,0:04:53.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不得不做了紧急子宫切除手术
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.24,0:04:57.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're never going to be able to have puppies, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.24,0:04:57.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你以后永远都生不了小狗了 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.20,0:05:00.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She could, however, eat whatever she liked,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.20,0:05:00.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过它倒是可以随便吃它想吃的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.56,0:05:05.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}whereas my diet was now in the iron grip of the doctor...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.56,0:05:05.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而我的饮食现在完全掌控在医生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.24,0:05:06.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.24,0:05:06.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}和丽莎的手里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:14.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thing is, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:14.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等等
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.36,0:05:17.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's cottage cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.36,0:05:17.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是农家鲜奶酪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.40,0:05:20.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Urgh, can't eat that shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.40,0:05:20.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我吃不了那玩意儿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.52,0:05:22.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.52,0:05:22.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太难吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.00,0:05:29.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.00,0:05:29.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.48,0:05:31.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Greek yoghurt. It's better for your microbes in your stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.48,0:05:31.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}希腊酸奶 对你的肠胃菌群有好处
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.52,0:05:34.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh fucking... What do you mean "wheat" yoghurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.52,0:05:34.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死 你说“小麦酸奶”是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:35.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Greek"!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:35.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是希腊酸奶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.12,0:05:37.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why would anybody eat Greek anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.12,0:05:37.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谁要吃希腊的任何东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.04,0:05:40.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because you're meant to for your stomach. It's better for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.04,0:05:40.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为你的胃需要 这对你有好处
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.76,0:05:42.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm not eating knob cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.76,0:05:42.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我才不吃难吃的奶酪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.60,0:05:46.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.60,0:05:46.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是什么？是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.12,0:05:48.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What is it? - Kale.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.12,0:05:48.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}羽衣甘蓝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.04,0:05:49.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh fuck...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.04,0:05:49.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我吃不了那玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.08,0:05:52.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I promise you, that is gonna be... I'm going to cook it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.08,0:05:52.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我向你保证 这个我要… 我要把它做熟了吃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.92,0:05:56.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wow, that was really bitter and horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.92,0:05:56.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这玩意儿…又苦又难吃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:58.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We farm beef,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:58.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们农场养牛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.52,0:05:59.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we farm lamb,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.52,0:05:59.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}养羊、养猪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.84,0:06:01.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we farm pork,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.84,0:06:03.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们在这儿就是靠这个谋生的 而我一样都不能吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.60,0:06:03.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it's what we do for a living here and I can't eat any of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.88,0:06:06.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can. Maybe once a month or twice a month
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.88,0:06:06.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以吃 大概一个月一两次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.52,0:06:09.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you can have a delicious lamb or a steak. Delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.52,0:06:09.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以吃一顿美味的 羊肉或者牛排 特别好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.08,0:06:10.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I can't! - You can!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.08,0:06:10.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我不能吃 - 你可以
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.44,0:06:12.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can't! Doctor Lucy said I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.44,0:06:12.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不能吃 露西医生说我不能吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.72,0:06:14.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That's not true. - And she said I can't drink
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.72,0:06:14.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 她说我不能喝酒… - 那不是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.32,0:06:17.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- 'cause my liver's fucked. - Well, your liver will recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.32,0:06:17.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- …因为我的肝废了 - 你的肝会恢复的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.80,0:06:21.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What, by tomorrow? - No, not by tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.80,0:06:21.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么？明天就能恢复吗？ - 不 明天不行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.80,0:06:23.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well then, what's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.80,0:06:23.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那还有什么意义？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.60,0:06:26.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What do you mean "what's the point"? Don't be such a petulant little child.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.60,0:06:26.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么叫“还有什么意义”？ 别跟个耍性子的小孩似的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.00,0:06:29.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just get healthier and then you can live life again in,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.00,0:06:30.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}先让身体好起来 然后你就能 重新过上正常的生活了 一点一点来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.16,0:06:30.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you know, bits and pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.12,0:06:33.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know, you were in fifth gear the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.12,0:06:33.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你一直都是以五档在跑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:37.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Fifth? - Go down to two-and-a-half gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:37.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 五档？ - 得降到二点五档才行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.16,0:06:38.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Fifth? Are you in 1984? - Seventh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.16,0:06:38.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 五档？ - 七档
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.72,0:06:39.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You were in seventh gear the whole time. - Ten...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.72,0:06:39.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你是活在1984年吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.92,0:06:43.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mustangs have ten speeds now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.92,0:06:43.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你一直都是以七档在跑 - 十档 野马现在有十个档位了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.20,0:06:45.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, you were in twelfth gear the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.20,0:06:45.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 你一直都是以十二档在跑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.48,0:06:48.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm not eating kale!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.48,0:06:48.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不吃羽衣甘蓝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.80,0:06:51.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna put loads of chilli and spring onion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.80,0:06:52.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我要放很多辣椒和香葱 会很好吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.00,0:06:52.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It'll be delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.88,0:06:55.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But vegetables are an accompaniment to meat, we know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.88,0:06:55.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但是蔬菜是肉的配菜 我们都知道这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.84,0:06:57.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Not for you anymore. - No, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.84,0:06:57.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对你来说不再是了 - 对 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:04.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With the car keys confiscated,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:04.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}车钥匙被没收后
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.84,0:07:08.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}my daily activities were limited to gentle dog walks
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.84,0:07:08.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我每天的日常活动就只剩下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.48,0:07:11.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}in the golden glow of Autumn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.48,0:07:11.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在金色的秋日里遛遛狗了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.72,0:07:16.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This was a good way of relaxing,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.72,0:07:16.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这倒是个不错的放松方式
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.80,0:07:19.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}unless I bumped into my sheeps,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.80,0:07:19.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}除非我撞见我的羊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.48,0:07:23.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}who remained as wilfully disobedient as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.48,0:07:23.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们还是跟以前一样故意不听话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.40,0:07:27.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I put them in this field 'cause I want them to graze all this long grass
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.40,0:07:27.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我把它们放到这块地里 是想让它们把这片长草都啃干净
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.24,0:07:29.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and all they're doing is eating the grass from the path
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.24,0:07:29.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}结果它们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.12,0:07:32.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that I mowed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.12,0:07:32.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}偏要吃我割过的那条小径上的草
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.96,0:07:35.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so I can walk the dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.96,0:07:35.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这条路是我割了用来遛狗的 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.44,0:07:37.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look. Eat the long...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.44,0:07:38.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}吃长的…这块我已经割过了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.28,0:07:38.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, I've already mowed this bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.92,0:07:40.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Go and eat over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.92,0:07:40.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}去那边吃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.24,0:07:44.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, don't! Go and eat this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.24,0:07:45.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 别…去那边吃 看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.20,0:07:45.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.52,0:07:47.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Are you talking to sheep? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.52,0:07:47.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你是在跟羊说话吗？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.56,0:07:51.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So there's, like, all of the food in the world there, hardly any food here:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.56,0:07:51.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那边明明有各种吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.00,0:07:53.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Right, we'll go and eat this." And then, of course, they shit on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.00,0:07:53.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这边几乎啥也没有 它们偏要跑过来吃这点草
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.36,0:07:55.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So if someone gave you a glass of wine
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.36,0:07:55.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后当然 还在上面拉屎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.44,0:07:57.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}or they gave you a bunch of grapes and said:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.44,0:07:57.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就比如有人给你一杯葡萄酒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.24,0:07:59.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Here, make the glass of wine," you'd just drink the glass of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.24,0:07:59.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}或者给你一串葡萄说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.32,0:08:02.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's like giving them a bunch of grapes. They've gotta search.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.32,0:08:02.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“来 你自己酿杯酒” 你肯定直接拿那杯酒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.00,0:08:06.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Don't talk to me about wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.00,0:08:04.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就跟给它们一串葡萄一样 它们得自己去找
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.52,0:08:06.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}别跟我提酒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.52,0:08:13.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The problem I had, though, is that to keep up
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.52,0:08:13.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我面临的问题是 为了满足…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.12,0:08:17.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with the pub's incessant demands for more meat,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.12,0:08:14.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（农夫的狗）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.08,0:08:17.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…酒吧对肉类不断增长的需求
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.08,0:08:19.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we needed more sheeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.08,0:08:19.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们需要更多的羊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.92,0:08:23.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So a week later, I bought another flock.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.92,0:08:23.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以一周后 我又买了一批羊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.92,0:08:28.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And this pleased Kaleb enormously.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.92,0:08:28.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这让卡莱布高兴坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.44,0:08:31.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What the fuck has he done now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.44,0:08:31.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他现在又搞什么名堂？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.96,0:08:44.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Have you not learnt anything in the last five years?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.96,0:08:44.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}过去这五年 你什么都没学会吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.56,0:08:45.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.56,0:08:45.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}学会了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.16,0:08:49.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When you get a pub, you need ten sheeps a week,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.16,0:08:49.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你开了个酒吧 一周需要十只羊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.08,0:08:51.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}fat lambs, a week, a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.08,0:08:51.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}肥羔羊 一周
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.32,0:08:52.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I've had to get more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.32,0:08:52.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我必须多弄点来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.68,0:08:55.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm literally surrounded with something I hate the most. I stood here,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.68,0:08:55.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在简直是 被我最讨厌的东西包围了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.04,0:08:56.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- there's sheep here... - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.04,0:08:56.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我站这儿 这边有羊 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.64,0:08:58.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's sheep over there by the farm shop, if you see them, over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.64,0:08:58.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那边农场商店旁边也有羊 你看见了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.28,0:08:59.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sheep by the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.28,0:09:00.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 房子旁边也有羊 我知道 - 房子旁边也有羊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.28,0:09:00.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And sheep by the house. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.84,0:09:03.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And these, this is my genius,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.84,0:09:03.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而这些…这就是我的天才之处了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.32,0:09:07.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}these are EasyCare sheep. That's what they're called, EasyCare.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.32,0:09:07.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些是易养羊 这个品种就叫“易养”
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.56,0:09:08.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mate, I'm gonna break this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.56,0:09:08.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 兄弟 我得跟你说清楚 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.96,0:09:11.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What? - No sheep is easy to care for.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.96,0:09:11.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没有哪个品种的羊是好养的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.36,0:09:12.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}These ones are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.36,0:09:12.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些就是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.48,0:09:15.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Let me just explain the details, if I may?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.48,0:09:15.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果可以的话 我来给你详细解释一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.00,0:09:16.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.00,0:09:17.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 说吧 - 它们不需要剪毛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.00,0:09:17.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They don't need shearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.84,0:09:21.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Their hair falls out by itself. So they don't get maggots.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.84,0:09:21.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们的毛自己会掉 所以也不会长蛆
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.28,0:09:22.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- All right. - That's number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.28,0:09:22.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 行吧 - 这是第一点
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.52,0:09:26.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're very, very easy to breed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.52,0:09:26.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们非常、非常容易繁殖
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.00,0:09:28.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and they lamb very simply.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.00,0:09:28.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且产羔非常简单
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.24,0:09:31.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you get good lambing,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.24,0:09:31.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以羔羊成活率高
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.88,0:09:33.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}very low maintenance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.88,0:09:33.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}维护成本非常低
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.56,0:09:36.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, think of it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.56,0:09:36.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 你这么想吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.48,0:09:37.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lamborghini.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.48,0:09:41.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}兰博基尼 以前是出了名的难开难养
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.76,0:09:41.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Very difficult things to drive and own in the olden days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.40,0:09:43.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Audi then come along,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.40,0:09:43.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}后来奥迪出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.44,0:09:47.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}blend Audi and Lamborghini together in the Aventador
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.44,0:09:47.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把奥迪和兰博基尼混在一起 就有了艾文塔多
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.84,0:09:50.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and you had an easy-care Lamborghini.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.84,0:09:50.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你就得到了一辆“易养版”兰博基尼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:54.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Was it easy care, though? - Well, more easy than the Countach.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:54.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那它真的易养吗？ - 比康塔什要好养多了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.56,0:09:58.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I then introduced Kaleb to John and Louise,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.56,0:09:58.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 我就把卡莱布 介绍给了约翰和路易丝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.04,0:10:00.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}who'd sold me the EasyCare sheeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.04,0:10:00.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就是卖给我易养羊的那对夫妇…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.28,0:10:01.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Hello! - Hi, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.28,0:10:01.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你们好 - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.68,0:10:03.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- How are you? Are you okay? - Hey! How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.68,0:10:03.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你好吗？没事吧？ - 嘿 你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.08,0:10:06.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}In the hope they could talk him round.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.08,0:10:06.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…希望他们能说服他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.28,0:10:08.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So Kaleb doesn't like sheep, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.28,0:10:08.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以卡莱布不喜欢羊？是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.52,0:10:09.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, he doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.52,0:10:09.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 他不喜欢 - 是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.64,0:10:13.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But I've been trying to convince him that these are sensible sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.64,0:10:13.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我一直在试着说服他 说这些羊是那种很省心的羊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.04,0:10:14.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Very sensible. Very sensible sheep indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.04,0:10:14.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 非常省心 - 确实是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.32,0:10:16.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And they lamb really easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.32,0:10:16.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}确实是非常省心的羊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.04,0:10:18.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's basically a wedge-shaped sheep with a long neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.04,0:10:18.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且它们产羔非常容易
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.28,0:10:27.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So what it does is it sort of... The lambs will just dive out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.28,0:10:22.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}基本上 它是一种楔形的羊 脖子很长
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.48,0:10:24.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以它就能…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.80,0:10:27.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}小羊羔直接就能滑出来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.12,0:10:28.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So what... - What? 'Cause it's pointy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.12,0:10:28.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以… - 是因为它尖吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.88,0:10:30.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because, yeah, it's more pointy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.88,0:10:30.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 因为它比较尖
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.36,0:10:32.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So the lamb is like an arrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.36,0:10:32.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以小羊羔就像一支箭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.72,0:10:34.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, something like that, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.72,0:10:34.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 差不多就那意思 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:37.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Listen, you're in for a good adventure with these sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:35.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}听着 养这些羊 你会有一段
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.96,0:10:37.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 很棒的体验 - 真的 它们…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.44,0:10:39.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, as soon as I saw the words "EasyCare sheep", I thought:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.44,0:10:39.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我一看到“易养羊”这几个字
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.44,0:10:41.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Count me in for some."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.44,0:10:41.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我就觉得 算我一个… - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.48,0:10:43.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- 'Cause I've got a dicky ticker. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.48,0:10:43.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 因为我心脏不好使了 - 是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.72,0:10:45.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So I need "easy care". - You didn't mention that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.72,0:10:45.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以我需要省心的 - 你之前没提过这事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.64,0:10:47.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I don't mention it much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.64,0:10:47.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不怎么提
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.20,0:10:48.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}To be fair, being serious, my mother dropped dead of a heart attack at 67.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.20,0:10:48.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说正经的 我妈在67岁的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.96,0:10:50.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Did she? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.96,0:10:50.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为心脏病发作突然去世
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.64,0:10:53.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- With furred up arteries, no clue. - Cheery news. My ticker's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.64,0:10:52.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是吗？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.04,0:10:53.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 这消息够振奋人心的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.68,0:10:55.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, no, they said her heart was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.68,0:10:55.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我没…我的心脏没问题 - 谁知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.56,0:10:59.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It was her arteries, exactly the same. - Yeah, exactly, that's what...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.56,0:10:58.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以…不 他们说她心脏没问题 - 心脏是好的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.36,0:10:59.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是动脉的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.44,0:11:04.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And, she'd walked around with a little thing in her chest for yonks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.44,0:11:00.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 完全一样 - 对 就是这个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.88,0:11:04.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}她胸口带着个小装置生活了好多年
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.20,0:11:05.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's what I've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.20,0:11:05.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在也带着那个
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.16,0:11:07.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And, erm... - And she dropped dead at 67.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.16,0:11:07.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 然后… - 然后她在67岁的时候突然走了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.04,0:11:09.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And they said: "You'll be fine." - Three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.04,0:11:09.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他们说她完全没问题 - 还有三年
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:10.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What? Until?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:10.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么 直到… - 我就挂了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.04,0:11:12.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I drop dead. - No, because you've had your stents.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.04,0:11:12.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不会的 不会 因为你现在已经做了支架了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.12,0:11:14.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Honestly, people from Yorkshire, I do like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.12,0:11:14.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我确实很喜欢…说真的 约克郡的人 我确实喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.80,0:11:16.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You'll be fine. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.80,0:11:16.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你会没事的 - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.16,0:11:18.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You'll be here forever. - Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.16,0:11:18.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你会一直好好的 - 操
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.20,0:11:20.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why is the doctor...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.20,0:11:20.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但为什么医生…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.12,0:11:27.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Besides lamb, the pub also needed more beef.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.12,0:11:27.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}除了羊肉 酒吧还需要更多牛肉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.52,0:11:30.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So with that in mind, I went off to scan my cows
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.52,0:11:30.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以考虑到这一点 我去给我的牛做扫描
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.84,0:11:34.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to see if End Game the bull had managed to get them pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.84,0:11:34.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看“终局”那头公牛 有没有成功让它们怀孕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.44,0:11:38.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Morning, End Game. How are you, my darling?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.44,0:11:38.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}早上好 终局 你好吗 我的宝贝？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.32,0:11:41.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}To be honest, I wasn't sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.32,0:11:41.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说实话 我也不太确定
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.88,0:11:45.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Clearly he enjoyed the company of the lady cows,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.88,0:11:45.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很明显 它喜欢和母牛们待在一起
