Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.28,0:15:21.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I feel like, this is a restart job already.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.28,0:15:21.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我感觉这是…得重来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.36,0:15:26.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, he can go through Eau Rouge flat-out, which is a corner at Spa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.36,0:15:25.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他可以全速通过艾尔罗格弯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.16,0:15:26.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是斯帕赛道上的一个弯道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.52,0:15:29.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And Oscar Piastri goes through Eau Rouge!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.52,0:15:29.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而奥斯卡皮亚斯特里 驶过艾尔罗日弯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.20,0:15:39.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Which is incredibly difficult and a brave thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.20,0:15:37.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那个弯道极其困难 而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.76,0:15:39.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 需要胆量 - 是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.88,0:15:42.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, that's the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.88,0:15:42.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不对 方向错了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.04,0:15:45.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But he is from the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.04,0:15:45.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但他毕竟是城里来的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.68,0:15:47.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I gotta go that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.68,0:15:47.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在我们往那边走
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.28,0:15:52.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The shed's over that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.28,0:15:52.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谷仓在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.36,0:15:55.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I need to go... that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.36,0:15:55.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我需要往那边走
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.04,0:16:01.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a good job he doesn't have to position his car on the grid like this
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.04,0:16:01.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}幸好他不用每周都这样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.16,0:16:04.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with a trailer on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.16,0:16:02.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把车摆上发车位
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.64,0:16:04.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还要拖挂车
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.80,0:16:08.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oscar? We're gonna go and get a cup of tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.80,0:16:08.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}奥斯卡 我们去喝杯茶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.92,0:16:10.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We'll come back out when you're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.92,0:16:10.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等你弄完了 我们再回来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.72,0:16:13.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think you can probably get dinner, to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.72,0:16:13.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说实话 我觉得 你们可能可以吃个晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.20,0:16:14.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It does go dark soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.20,0:16:14.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天很快就黑了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.92,0:16:16.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.92,0:16:16.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 你个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.56,0:16:20.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think we've established he can't reverse a trailer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.56,0:16:20.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我想我们已经得出结论了 他不会倒挂车
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.04,0:16:24.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oscar, however, hadn't got that memo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.04,0:16:24.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过奥斯卡显然不这么想
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.08,0:16:27.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All right, let's start from the very beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.08,0:16:27.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 我们从头开始
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.40,0:16:29.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the boy was no quitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.40,0:16:29.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且这小子绝不轻言放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.60,0:16:30.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.48,0:16:33.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oi. I went too early.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.48,0:16:33.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我转早了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.24,0:16:37.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With the afternoon light fading...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.24,0:16:37.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}随着午后的光线逐渐暗去…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.08,0:16:42.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How have I ended up that sideways?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.08,0:16:42.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我怎么搞得…歪成这样的？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.40,0:16:47.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I had to immerse myself in some exciting government paperwork
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.40,0:16:47.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…我不得不去处理一些 激动人心的政府文书工作
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.04,0:16:49.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and Kaleb had jobs to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.04,0:16:49.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而卡莱布也有活儿要干
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.28,0:16:52.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, we left Oscar to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.28,0:16:52.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}于是 我们把奥斯卡留在那儿继续
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.48,0:16:55.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No! Fuck me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.48,0:16:55.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 操
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.96,0:17:02.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A few days later...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.96,0:17:02.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}几天后…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.76,0:17:03.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.76,0:17:03.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.80,0:17:06.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With the EasyCare sheep settling in,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.80,0:17:06.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…易养羊安顿下来之后
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.60,0:17:09.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Dilwyn had come over to give them a check-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.60,0:17:09.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}迪尔翁过来给它们做检查
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.48,0:17:12.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which meant we... well, Kaleb...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.48,0:17:12.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这意味着我们…好吧 是卡莱布…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.28,0:17:13.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.28,0:17:13.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}过来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.60,0:17:16.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...had to herd them into an inspection pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.60,0:17:16.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…得把它们赶进检查用的围栏里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.96,0:17:19.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Go on then, girls! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.96,0:17:19.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 姑娘们 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:21.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Do you reckon he needs a hand? - I'm not allowed to do manual labour.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:21.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你觉得他需要帮忙吗？ - 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.04,0:17:22.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Are you not? - Six weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.04,0:17:22.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不能干体力活
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.96,0:17:25.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- 'Cause of the old ticker? - Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.96,0:17:24.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是吗？ - 六周
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.32,0:17:25.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为心脏问题？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.00,0:17:26.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.00,0:17:26.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.00,0:17:31.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The doctor said I've got to do nothing, just watch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.00,0:17:31.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}医生说我什么都不能干 就看着他
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.92,0:17:35.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a good job you're not a cow or a horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.92,0:17:35.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还好你不是牛也不是马
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.04,0:17:37.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I would have put you down by now. Wouldn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.04,0:17:37.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不然我早就把你处理掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.00,0:17:38.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Given the name of the sheep,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.00,0:17:38.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对吧？ - 快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.64,0:17:40.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we were expecting the round-up to be a doddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.64,0:17:40.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}考虑到这些羊的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.24,0:17:43.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hey, hey, hey, hey! Hey, hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.24,0:17:43.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们本以为赶羊会很轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.72,0:17:45.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hey, steady! Steady! Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.72,0:17:45.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.72,0:17:49.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I fucking hate sheep!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.72,0:17:47.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}慢点 喂
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.48,0:17:49.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我他妈真讨厌羊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.44,0:17:52.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.44,0:17:52.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.44,0:17:53.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.76,0:17:59.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're not easy-care, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.76,0:18:00.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它们一点都不省心 对吧？ - 确实不省心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.40,0:18:00.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.32,0:18:02.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're impossible-to-catch sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.32,0:18:02.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们根本就是抓不到的羊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.72,0:18:06.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Clearly, Kaleb needed help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.72,0:18:06.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}显然 卡莱布需要帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.20,0:18:09.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And since the sheep drone I'd used in the first series
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.20,0:18:09.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而我在第一季里用的赶羊无人机
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.40,0:18:11.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}had turned out to be useless,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.40,0:18:11.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}证明没什么用
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.44,0:18:14.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I decided to use my car instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.44,0:18:14.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我决定改用我的车
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.36,0:18:17.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Where are they? - In the fort.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.36,0:18:17.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它们在哪？ - 在那个堡垒里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.48,0:18:18.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, you're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.48,0:18:18.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你开玩笑吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.16,0:18:22.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't think we've ever been in here
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.16,0:18:22.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们在这个农场拍了这么久
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.68,0:18:24.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the whole time we've been filming on the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.68,0:18:24.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好像还从来没进来过这里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.40,0:18:26.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is a Neolithic fort.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.40,0:18:26.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在看到了 这是一个新石器时代的堡垒…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.64,0:18:30.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can see now it's just a bund in a rectangle
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.64,0:18:32.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}其实就是个长方形土堤 以前这里面是住人的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.52,0:18:32.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which used to house town.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.24,0:18:36.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We are now entering the ancient city,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.24,0:18:36.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们现在正在进入这座古城
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.64,0:18:38.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which is home now to my sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.64,0:18:38.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在这里住着我的羊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.04,0:18:42.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, now, you see, you're surprised, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.04,0:18:42.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们看 很惊讶吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.68,0:18:45.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause I'm gonna use technology to round you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.68,0:18:45.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我要用科技手段来赶你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.44,0:18:47.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.44,0:18:48.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}快点 从堡垒里出来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.56,0:18:48.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Out of the fort.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.56,0:18:51.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.56,0:18:51.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.48,0:18:52.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Out you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.48,0:18:52.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}出去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.32,0:18:54.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Uh-uh, that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.32,0:18:54.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}往那边走
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.88,0:18:56.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Get on with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.88,0:18:56.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}赶紧的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.32,0:18:58.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hey, we're getting them, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.32,0:18:58.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嘿 我们在赶了 各位
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.84,0:19:01.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With the inspection pen just yards away...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.84,0:19:01.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}检查围栏就在几码之外…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.92,0:19:02.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.92,0:19:02.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.92,0:19:05.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...success was a certainty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.92,0:19:05.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…成功本来是板上钉钉的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.92,0:19:09.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But then, a splinter group jumped over the electric fence...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.92,0:19:09.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但就在这时 一小群羊跳过了电围栏
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.36,0:19:12.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit, shit, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.36,0:19:12.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.12,0:19:15.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the rest sold us a dummy and broke free as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.12,0:19:15.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}剩下的羊也糊弄了我们一下 跟着逃了出去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.64,0:19:18.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Argh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.60,0:19:22.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, don't go back in, you stupid things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.60,0:19:22.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}别往回走了 你们这些蠢东西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.76,0:19:25.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shall we kill 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.76,0:19:25.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们把它们宰了算了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.64,0:19:32.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.64,0:19:32.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.60,0:19:35.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, we're not killing them. But, I mean, look...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.60,0:19:35.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 我们不杀它们 但是 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.64,0:19:38.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now they've gone back in the bloody fort.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.64,0:19:38.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们现在又跑回 那个该死的堡垒里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.40,0:19:44.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With the sheep very much not in the pen,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.40,0:19:44.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}羊群完全不在围栏里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.32,0:19:49.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we were forced to deploy every resource we had.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.32,0:19:49.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们被迫动用所有能用的资源
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.40,0:19:51.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Close that gap a little bit, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.40,0:19:51.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把那边的口子收小一点 本
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.36,0:19:52.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The film crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.36,0:19:52.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}摄制组
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.88,0:19:54.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Everyone squeeze up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.88,0:19:54.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}各位 往中间挤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.04,0:19:57.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, with the entire production crew on it...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.04,0:19:57.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 整个制作团队都上了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.00,0:19:58.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We got this. We got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.00,0:19:58.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们能搞定 能搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.92,0:20:05.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Don't be an arsehole.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.92,0:20:05.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}别犯浑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.24,0:20:09.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We tried every formation we could think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.24,0:20:09.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们试遍了能想到的所有阵型
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.88,0:20:11.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}On the far right-hand side, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.88,0:20:11.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}请靠最右边
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.96,0:20:14.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.96,0:20:14.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}快
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.48,0:20:16.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Connor, close that gap again, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.48,0:20:16.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}康纳 再把那个口子收一下 老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.00,0:20:19.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But it was like trying to outfox Real Madrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.00,0:20:19.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但这简直就像智胜皇马一样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.92,0:20:20.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.92,0:20:20.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.92,0:20:25.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, look at them. Back in again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.92,0:20:25.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看它们 又往回走了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.68,0:20:31.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Let's go home. Try again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.68,0:20:31.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们回家吧 明天再试
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.84,0:20:35.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, that was a complete waste of an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.84,0:20:35.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 这一个小时真是完全白费了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.72,0:20:36.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.72,0:20:38.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是啊 - 也白费了你花的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.68,0:20:38.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And a waste of your bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.24,0:20:39.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, we tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.24,0:20:39.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 我们尽力了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.84,0:20:41.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.84,0:20:41.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗯 - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.72,0:20:44.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.72,0:20:46.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 卡莱布 关于这些羊 你也许说得有道理
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.04,0:20:46.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You may have a point, Kaleb, about these sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.88,0:20:48.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm blaming this on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.88,0:20:48.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我把这事怪你头上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.48,0:20:51.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I vowed there and then
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.48,0:20:54.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我当时就发誓再也不买任何羊了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.32,0:20:54.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}never to buy any more sheep ever again...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.80,0:21:05.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Which made my visit to the barn the following morning
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.80,0:21:05.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我第二天早上去谷仓时
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.84,0:21:07.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}rather disturbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.84,0:21:07.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看到的景象相当让人不安
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.96,0:21:11.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What the fuck are they? - I dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.96,0:21:11.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这他妈是什么东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.28,0:21:12.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- They're not sheep. What are they? - They are sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.28,0:21:12.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.60,0:21:15.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Unless they're a goat. - What are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.60,0:21:14.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它们不是羊…它们是什么？ - 它们是羊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.48,0:21:16.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 除非它们是山羊 - 它们是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.00,0:21:19.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look, they've run at very high speed into a wall
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.00,0:21:19.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们看起来像是全速撞到墙上
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.28,0:21:21.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and smashed their snout.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.28,0:21:21.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把鼻子撞扁了一样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.48,0:21:23.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.48,0:21:23.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.16,0:21:26.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's not a sheep! They've got no eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.16,0:21:26.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那可不是羊 它们连眼睛都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.24,0:21:28.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- But I mean, whose are they? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.24,0:21:28.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 谁的…我是说 它们是谁的？ - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.68,0:21:31.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Soon, the mystery was solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.68,0:21:31.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很快 谜团就解开了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.88,0:21:33.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, aren't they gorgeous?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.88,0:21:33.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们是不是很漂亮？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.64,0:21:35.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're my little Valois!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.64,0:21:35.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的小瓦莱羊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.64,0:21:37.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You bought them? - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.64,0:21:37.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是你买的？ - 黑鼻羊 对
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.48,0:21:39.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And you put 'em in here? - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.48,0:21:39.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你把它们放这儿了？ - 对！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.40,0:21:41.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, they have to settle down for a couple of weeks
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.40,0:21:41.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们得先适应几周
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.04,0:21:43.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause they've just arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.04,0:21:43.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为它们才刚到
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.08,0:21:45.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no, sorry, Lisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.08,0:21:45.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不是 抱歉 丽莎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.12,0:21:49.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}why have you bought five flat-faced, eyeless sheep?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.12,0:21:47.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你为什么买了五只
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.32,0:21:49.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}脸扁扁的、没眼睛的羊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.56,0:21:52.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because, I thought we could put them in the copse
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.56,0:21:53.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我想我们可以把它们放在 小树林里 我可以用它们来繁殖
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.40,0:21:53.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and I could breed them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.80,0:21:57.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Because they're quite expe... - Breed them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.80,0:21:57.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 因为它们挺贵的… - 你来繁殖？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.08,0:21:59.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. They're quite expensive to buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.08,0:21:59.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 它们买来挺贵的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.08,0:22:00.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How much are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.08,0:22:00.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}多少钱？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.52,0:22:01.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- They're two. - Two hundred quid?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.52,0:22:01.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们两…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.60,0:22:04.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.60,0:22:03.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 两百英镑？ - 两百英镑一只？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.40,0:22:04.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}千
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.24,0:22:08.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Each? - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.24,0:22:08.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 一只？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.28,0:22:11.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.28,0:22:11.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.92,0:22:15.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But... I thought if I could go... These... Okay, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.92,0:22:15.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我想如果我能把这些… 行 你听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.16,0:22:18.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa! There's £10,000 worth of sheep just here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.16,0:22:18.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就这么几头羊值一万英镑？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.88,0:22:22.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Diddly Squat, Hobby Farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.88,0:22:22.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}迪丽斯库阿特 业余爱好农场
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.44,0:22:25.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It is, literally. £10,000, Lisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.44,0:22:25.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就是一万英镑 丽莎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.52,0:22:28.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know, but can you imagine what I can sell the babies for if they breed?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.52,0:22:28.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 但你想想 如果它们繁殖了 我能把小羊卖多少钱？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.48,0:22:31.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I will breed them. So these have all been blood-tested,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.48,0:22:31.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且我一定会让它们繁殖的 这些都已经做过血检了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.04,0:22:32.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- so I'll get an AI ram in. - Where are they from?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.04,0:22:32.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我会用人工智能…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.76,0:22:34.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}From up in Cheshire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.76,0:22:34.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们是从哪儿来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.48,0:22:36.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Cheshire? There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.48,0:22:36.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}从柴郡那边
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.36,0:22:38.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Every single Manchester United footballer's wife
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.36,0:22:38.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}柴郡 这就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.32,0:22:41.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}has these as a pet, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.32,0:22:41.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}曼联球员的老婆人手一只
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.12,0:22:45.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- They will do. - They will be when I sell it to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.12,0:22:43.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}都把这种羊当宠物养 是吧？ 它们会成为…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.68,0:22:45.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等我把它们卖给她们 她们就会养
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.20,0:22:47.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wilmslow sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.20,0:22:47.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}威尔姆斯洛羊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.28,0:22:50.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I'll leave you to. You're going to have to deal with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.28,0:22:50.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 我把这些留给你… 你能不能…你得处理这个了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.56,0:22:51.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.56,0:22:51.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}行
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.68,0:22:53.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We could skin 'em and put 'em on the bathroom floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.68,0:22:53.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们可以把它们的皮剥了 铺在浴室地板上
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.96,0:22:56.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Don't tease them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.96,0:22:56.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}别闹了！别拿它们开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.72,0:23:03.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}One of the things the doctor had especially banned me from doing
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.72,0:23:03.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}医生特别禁止我做的一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.28,0:23:05.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}was going to my pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.28,0:23:05.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就是去我的酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.88,0:23:08.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Partly, this was to stop me drinking in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.88,0:23:08.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一方面是为了阻止我在酒吧里喝酒
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.24,0:23:11.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But mostly, it was to stop me stressing about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.24,0:23:11.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但主要还是为了阻止我为它操心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.92,0:23:14.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I had to ignore her, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.92,0:23:14.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过 我还是得无视她的嘱咐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.56,0:23:18.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because the list of problems was becoming huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.56,0:23:18.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为问题清单变得越来越长了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.16,0:23:19.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（农夫的狗）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.96,0:23:23.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Power is one of the biggest problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.96,0:23:23.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}电力是最大的问题之一
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.16,0:23:26.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}To get enough electricity up here to run the pub, we'd need new cables,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.16,0:23:26.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}要给这里供上足够的电力来运营酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.68,0:23:30.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which would cost £200,000, and obviously that's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.68,0:23:30.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们需要铺设新电缆 那要花二十万英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.88,0:23:35.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we've had to hire this generator,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.88,0:23:33.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}显然 这太离谱了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.04,0:23:35.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 我们不得不租下这台发电机
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.48,0:23:40.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and it costs £100 a day, a day, to fuel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.48,0:23:40.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}光是燃料每天就要 花一百英镑 仅仅一天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.80,0:23:44.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mind you, that's nothing compared to the cost of theft.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.80,0:23:44.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过相比失窃成本 这都不算什么
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.68,0:23:49.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just last night somebody stole £200 worth of cooking oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.68,0:23:49.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就在昨晚 有人偷走了 价值两百英镑的烹饪油
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.60,0:23:52.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And that's not the maddest thing that gets nicked from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.60,0:23:52.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而这还不是这里被偷走的 最离谱的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.64,0:23:54.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Every single day somebody steals the light bulbs...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.64,0:23:54.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.52,0:23:59.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and the urinal traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.52,0:23:59.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}都有人偷灯泡和小便池的滤网
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.40,0:24:02.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've had to screw these down to stop them being nicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.40,0:24:02.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们不得不把这些东西 用螺丝拧死 防止被偷
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.44,0:24:04.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Who steals a urinal trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.44,0:24:04.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谁会偷小便池滤网啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.84,0:24:06.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.84,0:24:06.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}玻璃杯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.56,0:24:09.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wanna hazard a guess at how many of these are stolen every week?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.56,0:24:09.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你猜猜每周有多少个杯子被偷？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.80,0:24:13.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, you're quite wrong. It's 400.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.80,0:24:13.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 你猜得不对 是四百个
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.36,0:24:19.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}400 glasses a week are nicked from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.36,0:24:18.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每周四百个玻璃杯…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.08,0:24:19.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}从这儿被偷走
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.76,0:24:22.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}For some reason we don't have enough water pressure up here
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.76,0:24:22.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为某些原因 我们这里的水压不够
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.20,0:24:25.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so we've had to install this 6,000-litre tank
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.20,0:24:25.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们安装了这个六千升的水箱
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.80,0:24:27.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which fills up overnight,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.80,0:24:27.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它会在夜间蓄满水
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.36,0:24:29.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and even this isn't big enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.36,0:24:29.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可就连这个都不够用
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.48,0:24:32.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, we just keep running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.48,0:24:32.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我是说 我们…我们就老是把水用光
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.48,0:24:34.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is the overflow car park
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.48,0:24:34.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是备用停车场
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.28,0:24:35.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and we've had to put hardcore down,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.28,0:24:35.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们不得不铺上碎石 因为你也看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.72,0:24:39.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because, as you can see here, everyone was getting stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.72,0:24:39.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}之前大家都陷在泥里
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.16,0:24:41.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We even got a fire engine stuck the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.16,0:24:41.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}前几天连消防车都陷进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.12,0:24:43.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Then there's the tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.12,0:24:43.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后就是帐篷的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.28,0:24:46.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Every morning the roof is lined with condensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.28,0:24:46.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每天早上 帐篷顶都结满冷凝水
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.44,0:24:50.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And if it's windy, it gets shaken loose, so it's raining in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.44,0:24:49.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果刮风 水就会被晃下来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.08,0:24:51.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那么里面就会下雨
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.40,0:24:53.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Then you've got staff problems, complaining to HR, which is basically me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.40,0:24:53.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 还有员工问题
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.84,0:24:55.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Charlotte, for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.84,0:24:55.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们向人事投诉 也就是我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.88,0:24:57.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Charlotte runs the butcher's counter.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.88,0:24:57.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}比如说夏洛特
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.76,0:25:02.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And, you moaned, with some justification,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.76,0:25:00.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}夏洛特负责肉品柜台 然后…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.00,0:25:02.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你抱怨过 而且很有道理
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.20,0:25:04.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that customers were saying you look like Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.20,0:25:04.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你当时说 顾客说你长得像卡莱布
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.48,0:25:08.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There was a comment that I was Kaleb after transition.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.48,0:25:08.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有人评论说… 我是做了变性手术后的卡莱布
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.12,0:25:13.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}See? This is what you have to deal with as a landlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.12,0:25:13.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 这就是当老板要处理的事
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.00,0:25:21.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There was, however, a more immediate problem to take care of,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.00,0:25:21.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过 还有一个更紧迫的问题要处理
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.04,0:25:24.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because with November the fifth fast approaching,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.04,0:25:24.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为十一月五日快到了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.00,0:25:28.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb and I needed to build the bonfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.00,0:25:28.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布和我需要搭建篝火
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.12,0:25:29.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.12,0:25:29.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}往后倒
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.20,0:25:31.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And before getting stuck in,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.20,0:25:31.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在开始干活之前
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.52,0:25:34.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I had to lay out the terms of my employment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.52,0:25:34.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我得先说明我的工作条件
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.20,0:25:37.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know, sadly, I can't help you with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.20,0:25:37.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很遗憾 这个忙我帮不了你
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.20,0:25:38.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.20,0:25:38.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}行 那你回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.56,0:25:41.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, I need to be here to advise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.56,0:25:41.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 我得在这儿给你当顾问
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.16,0:25:43.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But don't argue 'cause I can't have stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.16,0:25:43.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但是你…别吵 因为我不能有压力
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.96,0:25:47.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So first of all, we need to get a triangular shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.96,0:25:47.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}首先 我们需要摆成一个三角形
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.20,0:25:48.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, not necessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.20,0:25:48.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不一定
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.60,0:25:51.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What we do now, look, is you just put the pallets
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.60,0:25:51.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们现在要做的 就是把运货板…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.32,0:25:53.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- either side over the top of this. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.32,0:25:53.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 放在两边 盖在上面 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.20,0:25:55.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We just literally keep that in the centre.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.20,0:25:55.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们就把那个放在中间就行
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.00,0:25:57.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You can't have a cube-shaped bonfire. - You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.00,0:25:57.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这边留一个走路的通道 - 篝火不能堆成立方体形
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.28,0:25:58.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You can't. - You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.28,0:25:58.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 可以 - 不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.72,0:26:00.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You just can't. - You can!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.72,0:26:00.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 可以 - 就是不行
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.56,0:26:04.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, what you need is a pole down the middle, a tree log, down the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.56,0:26:02.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 可以 - 不行 你需要的是
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.44,0:26:04.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在中间立一根杆子 一根树干 立在中间
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.48,0:26:07.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then you stack things up like a wigwam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.48,0:26:07.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后像帐篷一样 把东西往上堆
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.48,0:26:09.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That has to be the shape of your bonfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.48,0:26:09.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}篝火必须是那个形状
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.32,0:26:12.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Once we'd agreed that I was right,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.32,0:26:12.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当我们一致认为我是对的之后
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.28,0:26:16.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the first job was to find some logs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.28,0:26:16.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第一项任务是找一些原木
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.04,0:26:18.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You have to get over that way a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.04,0:26:18.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你得往那边过去一点
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.80,0:26:21.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What? You pull it that way? Just pull it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.80,0:26:21.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你把它往那边拉就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.20,0:26:23.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Are you gonna get out and pull it over? - No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.20,0:26:23.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你就拉一下 - 你下车 拉过去
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.44,0:26:25.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Well, you're gonna have to. - I can't. My doctor says
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.44,0:26:25.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不 我不去 - 但你必须得去 如果你…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.56,0:26:28.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can't pull logs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.56,0:26:28.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不能 医生说我不能拉原木
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.60,0:26:30.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, you can't do anything. You can pull a log!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.60,0:26:30.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你什么都干不了 拉个原木还是能拉的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.52,0:26:32.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can't. You're standing there!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.52,0:26:32.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我不能 你就站在那儿呢！ - 或者就往那边过去一点点…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.16,0:26:34.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Go that way a little bit and grab it. - Just don't give me stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.16,0:26:34.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 然后抓起来 - 别给我施压
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.60,0:26:36.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}For fuck's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.60,0:26:36.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看在上帝的份上
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.44,0:26:41.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I really do like working in these new conditions
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.44,0:26:41.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我真的很喜欢在这种新条件下工作
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.76,0:26:43.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}where I can just point at things...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.76,0:26:43.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我只需要指指点点 然后…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.00,0:26:45.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You're loving this, aren't you? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.00,0:26:45.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你很享受这样 是吧？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.88,0:26:47.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't like this new you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.88,0:26:47.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不喜欢这个全新的你
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.16,0:26:48.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, you didn't like the old me very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.16,0:26:48.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你之前也没多喜欢原来的我
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.44,0:26:50.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I didn't, to be fair! You're right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.44,0:26:50.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}确实 说实话 这点你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.00,0:26:54.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I do love this little sports.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.00,0:26:54.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我确实挺享受这点小乐趣的 - 挺好的 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.40,0:26:56.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's good, innit? It's great. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.40,0:26:56.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗯 - 很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.92,0:26:58.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You do look abnormal, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.92,0:26:58.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过你看上去确实不太正常
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.80,0:27:02.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm in a mobility scooter is what I'm in!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.80,0:27:02.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我坐在我的…我坐在我的代步车上 这就是我现在的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.24,0:27:03.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- This is the mobility... - This is what I would get you
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.24,0:27:03.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就是代步…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.36,0:27:05.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}on the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.36,0:27:05.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是我会给你配备的农场用品
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.36,0:27:07.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The mobility scooter of JCBs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.36,0:27:07.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}JCB版代步车
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.40,0:27:11.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This requires skill and precision,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.40,0:27:11.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这需要技巧和精准度
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.52,0:27:13.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}both of which I have in abundance.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.52,0:27:13.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这两样我都有 还很充沛 - 好了没？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.40,0:27:15.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fucking useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.40,0:27:15.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真他妈没用
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.48,0:27:17.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You stupid idiot! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.48,0:27:17.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你个蠢货！ - 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.92,0:27:20.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's the worst loading I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.92,0:27:20.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这是我见过的装得最烂的木头 - 操！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.08,0:27:22.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Don't worry, Kaleb, with editing it'll look like you know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.08,0:27:22.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}别担心 卡莱布 通过剪辑
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.68,0:27:26.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm just getting... You arsehole!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.68,0:27:24.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这看起来会像 你知道自己在干什么一样
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.24,0:27:26.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我正要…你个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.20,0:27:32.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's a good, long, straight log.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.20,0:27:32.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这根又长又直的原木不错
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.28,0:27:34.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's what you need as the spine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.28,0:27:34.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就是你需要的主心骨
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.84,0:27:43.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's hard work putting that in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.84,0:27:43.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把它放进去可真是个体力活
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.44,0:27:45.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, now we're starting to take shape. Our bonfire is gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.44,0:27:45.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 现在总算有点样子了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.56,0:27:48.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.56,0:27:48.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们的篝火就… - 你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.40,0:27:49.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I didn't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.40,0:27:49.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我什么都没干
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.44,0:27:50.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You just pushed it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.44,0:27:50.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你刚才把它推倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.52,0:27:53.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I didn't push it out! I was talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.52,0:27:53.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我没推 我正跟你说话呢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.00,0:27:54.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You did that on purpose. - I did not do...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.00,0:27:54.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你故意的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.48,0:27:56.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Why? - You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.48,0:27:56.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我没有…为什么… - 你就是
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.08,0:27:59.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Why I'd knock our bonfire down? - You were pushing the boom out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.08,0:27:58.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}给我个理由 我为什么 要推倒我们自己的篝火？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.12,0:28:00.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道 但你在把铲臂往前推
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.84,0:28:03.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Fuck's sake. - Stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.84,0:28:03.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我操
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.08,0:28:04.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fuck me. It's like talking to a fucking brick wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.08,0:28:04.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}压力
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.36,0:28:08.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's funny, you can feel it. You can feel it building.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.36,0:28:06.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}妈的 跟你说话简直像对牛弹琴
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.44,0:28:09.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有意思 你能感觉到 你能感觉到压力越来越大
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.20,0:28:11.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.20,0:28:11.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布 你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.84,0:28:15.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know a lot of farmers have bonfire nights?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.84,0:28:15.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很多农场主都会办篝火之夜
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.04,0:28:16.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.04,0:28:16.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.20,0:28:19.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is that because they can get rid of certain things on the farm?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.20,0:28:19.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是不是因为可以在那天 处理掉农场里的某些东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.80,0:28:22.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Absolutely not. It's to get the family together.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.80,0:28:22.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当然不是 是为了让家人聚在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.16,0:28:23.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. - Eating, erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.16,0:28:23.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗯 - 对 而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.80,0:28:26.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But if you could see the colour of the smoke coming off the bonfire,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.80,0:28:26.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但如果你能看到篝火 冒出来的烟是什么颜色
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.88,0:28:29.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which you can't 'cause it's night obviously on Bonfire Night...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.88,0:28:29.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当然你看不到 因为是在晚上 篝火之夜嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.96,0:28:32.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, I do think a lot of farmers do like Bonfire Night.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.96,0:28:32.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 我确实觉得 很多农场主都喜欢篝火之夜
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.16,0:28:34.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I love Bonfire Night because you can just get certain things...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.16,0:28:34.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我喜欢篝火之夜是因为… - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.20,0:28:35.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, your farm's a lot tidier the next day.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.20,0:28:35.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…你可以把某些东西…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.52,0:28:38.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A hundred percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.52,0:28:37.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二天你的农场就整洁多了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.32,0:28:38.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}百分之百
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.76,0:28:41.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That's going to the skip. - Of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.76,0:28:40.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那些是要扔进垃圾箱的 别盯着看
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.36,0:28:41.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当然是要扔的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.08,0:28:44.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Keep coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.08,0:28:44.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}继续开
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.32,0:28:48.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With the centre pole and the pallets in place...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.32,0:28:48.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}中心柱和运货板就位之后…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.48,0:28:49.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.48,0:28:49.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}完美
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.84,0:28:53.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The next job was to dress it with the bushes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.84,0:28:53.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…下一步就是用灌木丛把它装饰起来
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.36,0:28:57.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If I get the sports telehandler then I'll simply push this onto there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.36,0:28:57.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我开那辆伸缩臂叉车 我直接把这个推上去就行
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.68,0:28:59.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That won't work. You'll make a mess over that side.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.68,0:28:59.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那样不行 那边会被你搞得一团糟
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.36,0:29:01.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I promise I won't. - It won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.36,0:29:01.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我保证不会 - 行不通的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.28,0:29:03.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It will. Just watch and then you'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.28,0:29:03.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}能行 你看着就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.52,0:29:13.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.52,0:29:13.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.04,0:29:17.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That went well.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.04,0:29:17.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}进展顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.40,0:29:19.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.40,0:29:19.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}非常顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.88,0:29:23.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That was a car park. It's now a fucking mud bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.88,0:29:23.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这儿本来是停车场 现在变成了个泥潭
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.56,0:29:30.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Eager to get the thing finished,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.56,0:29:30.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们急着想把这事干完
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.32,0:29:33.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we continued working into the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.32,0:29:33.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}于是一直干到了天黑
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.04,0:29:37.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And progress was made.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.04,0:29:37.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且确实取得了进展
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.76,0:29:40.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you knock it all down now I'll literally cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.76,0:29:40.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你现在把它全部推倒 我真的会哭
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.52,0:29:43.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How brilliant's that? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.52,0:29:43.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}厉不厉害？嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.20,0:29:46.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shall I tell you what's funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.20,0:29:46.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我跟你说有趣的事
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.44,0:29:48.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know this programme's watched in America?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.44,0:29:48.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道 这个节目 在美国也有观众看吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.72,0:29:52.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're gonna wonder what the bloody hell we're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.72,0:29:50.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗯 - 他们会好奇
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.16,0:29:52.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们到底在搞什么鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.44,0:29:55.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They don't know what Bonfire Night is.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.44,0:29:55.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们不知道篝火之夜是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.08,0:29:57.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We ought to ex... Actually, you explain it to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.08,0:29:57.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们应该解释… 要不你来跟他们解释吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.24,0:30:00.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.24,0:30:00.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.52,0:30:04.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Explain to our American audience why we do this every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.52,0:30:02.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}给我们的美国观众解释一下
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.60,0:30:04.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么我们每年都要搞这个
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.96,0:30:07.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Who do we put on top?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.96,0:30:07.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们会在顶上放谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.20,0:30:12.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Guy Fawkes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.20,0:30:12.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}盖伊福克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.72,0:30:16.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, so Guy Fawkes, back in the 17th century,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.72,0:30:16.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好 盖伊福克斯 在十七世纪的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.68,0:30:18.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}tried to blow up the Houses of Parliament,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.68,0:30:18.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}试图炸毁议会大厦 炸掉政府
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.72,0:30:21.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}blow up the government. He failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.72,0:30:22.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他失败了 他被抓住了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.20,0:30:22.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He was caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.64,0:30:26.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And every single year we commemorate his failure
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.64,0:30:26.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而每年 我们都会通过
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.48,0:30:29.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}by burning an effigy of him on a bonfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.48,0:30:29.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}焚烧他的肖像来纪念他的失败
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.36,0:30:32.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And everyone does it. Everyone. There are fireworks
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.36,0:30:32.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每个人都会这么做 所有人 还有烟花
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.32,0:30:33.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- and we celebrate his failure. - How did he fail?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.32,0:30:33.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们庆祝他的失败
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.88,0:30:38.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They stacked the basement of the Houses of Parliament with gunpowder
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.88,0:30:35.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他是怎么失败的？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.04,0:30:39.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们在议会大厦的 地下室里堆满了火药
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.00,0:30:41.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then the guy he'd appointed to look after it fell asleep
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.00,0:30:41.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后被指派看守火药的那个人睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.68,0:30:43.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and the guards found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.68,0:30:43.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卫兵发现了他
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.36,0:30:46.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hey, but you don't have to have Guy Fawkes on the top of the bonfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.36,0:30:46.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过篝火顶上 不一定非要放盖伊福克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.56,0:30:48.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What do you have? A tyre?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.56,0:30:48.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那你放什么？轮胎？ - 可以放任何东西
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.60,0:30:49.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Anything you don't like.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.60,0:30:49.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}任何你不喜欢的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.12,0:30:52.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Good? - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.12,0:30:52.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好了吗？ - 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.44,0:30:54.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I'm knocking it on the head for tonight. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.44,0:30:54.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 今晚我就把它锁在那儿了 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.76,0:30:56.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, it looks pretty good from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.76,0:30:56.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 从这儿看过去挺不错的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.12,0:31:03.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A couple of days later,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.12,0:31:03.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}几天后 迪尔翁又该来了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.64,0:31:06.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Dilwyn was due back to try, once again,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.64,0:31:09.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}再次尝试检查我的新易养羊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.68,0:31:10.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to check over my new EasyCare sheeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.80,0:31:15.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, second attempt to get these sheep in the crush,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.80,0:31:15.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 第二次尝试 把这些羊赶进检查栏
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.08,0:31:17.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}made doubly difficult
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.08,0:31:17.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这事难上加难 因为卡莱布…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.52,0:31:20.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because Kaleb has, it being November,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.52,0:31:22.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在是十一月 他带着家人去康沃尔度假了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.12,0:31:22.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}taken his family on holiday to Cornwall.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.56,0:31:25.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I'm going to try and use the dogs as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.56,0:31:25.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我打算也用上狗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.56,0:31:27.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.56,0:31:27.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.64,0:31:32.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Dogs, you need leads on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.64,0:31:32.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}狗 得给你们拴上牵引绳
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.28,0:31:34.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sansa, Arya, heel! Heel!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.28,0:31:34.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}珊莎、艾莉亚 跟
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.36,0:31:36.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oi, you need your leads on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.36,0:31:36.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们…得给你们拴上牵引绳
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.24,0:31:39.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.24,0:31:39.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}别…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.92,0:31:41.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.92,0:31:41.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.52,0:31:44.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.52,0:31:45.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}行吧 那就我自己来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.40,0:31:45.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just me, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.20,0:31:50.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, these EasyCare sheep have positioned themselves...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.20,0:31:50.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 这些易养羊把自己定位在了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.36,0:31:54.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}at exactly the wrong end of the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.36,0:31:54.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}田里最不好搞的那一端
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.24,0:31:57.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Except, as it turned out, for one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.24,0:31:57.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}结果证明 其中一只除外
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.28,0:32:01.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, God above.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.28,0:32:01.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}老天爷哦…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.56,0:32:04.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's dead, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.56,0:32:04.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它死了 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.84,0:32:11.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's a big wound in its neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.84,0:32:11.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它脖子上有个大伤口
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.64,0:32:14.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fortunately, Dilwyn then arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.64,0:32:14.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}幸运的是 迪尔翁随后抵达
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.96,0:32:15.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hi, Dilwyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.96,0:32:16.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗨 迪尔翁 - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.96,0:32:17.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hi there. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.60,0:32:19.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ah, the ear's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.60,0:32:19.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不好 耳朵没了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.20,0:32:20.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's no ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.20,0:32:20.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没有耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.12,0:32:23.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, who would eat a sheep's ear?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.12,0:32:23.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谁会吃羊耳朵啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.16,0:32:25.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Dogs. Dog worrying is a terrible problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.16,0:32:25.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}狗 狗撕咬是个很严重的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.92,0:32:28.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When I was in Herefordshire, working in Herefordshire,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.92,0:32:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我在赫里福德郡工作的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.92,0:32:30.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the police would bring a dog in and say:
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.92,0:32:30.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}警察带一只狗过来说
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.76,0:32:34.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"We're worried about this dog has been worrying sheep."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.76,0:32:34.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“我们担心这只狗有撕咬羊的问题”
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.00,0:32:36.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And we'd make that dog vomit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.00,0:32:36.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我们就给那只狗催吐
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.84,0:32:40.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And if it vomited up wool, it was put down there and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.84,0:32:40.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果它吐出了羊毛 那就会当场被处死
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.80,0:32:41.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- No way! - It was. That was in, er...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.80,0:32:41.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.72,0:32:45.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}1990.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.72,0:32:45.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}会的 那是…1990年的事
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.56,0:32:46.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.56,0:32:46.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好吧 所以… - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.72,0:32:49.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes. Also, I think the crows have had a go at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.72,0:32:49.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且 我觉得乌鸦也对它下过口了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.40,0:32:51.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The eyes, I see that the eyes... The crows have taken the eyes, have they?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.40,0:32:51.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 眼睛 我看到眼睛… - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.20,0:32:52.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, and the backside here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.20,0:32:52.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}乌鸦把眼睛叼走了 是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.84,0:32:56.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What, the crows have eaten her anus?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.84,0:32:54.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 还有屁股这里
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.60,0:32:56.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么？乌鸦把肛门吃了？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.60,0:32:59.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. It's just they tend to poke in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.60,0:32:59.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 它们就喜欢往那里啄
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.12,0:33:00.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.12,0:33:00.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.40,0:33:01.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They can poke their...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.40,0:33:01.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们可以把嘴伸进去…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.76,0:33:05.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and literally pull the lining, the gut out through the anus.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.76,0:33:05.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后直接把肠子 内脏从肛门里拽出来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.96,0:33:09.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then the crows have thought: "Oh, here we go, let's have a feast."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.96,0:33:07.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后乌鸦就想
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.60,0:33:09.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“来吧 我们大吃一顿”
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.76,0:33:13.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I hope I don't come back as a crow.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.76,0:33:13.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}希望我下辈子别变成乌鸦
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.12,0:33:14.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the other thing I can see, she's also quite swollen in her right hind there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.12,0:33:14.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我还能看到另一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.92,0:33:17.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Quite what? - Quite swollen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.92,0:33:17.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它的右后腿这里也肿得挺厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.40,0:33:19.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, isn't that rigor mortis?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.40,0:33:19.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么？ - 肿得厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.24,0:33:21.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No. That's all gangrene that's set in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.24,0:33:21.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那不是尸僵吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.08,0:33:25.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Gangrene? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.08,0:33:24.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不是 那里面已经全是坏疽了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.24,0:33:25.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 坏疽？ - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.60,0:33:27.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What manner of death is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.60,0:33:27.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这到底是怎么死的？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.68,0:33:30.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A dog tears your ear off and then you get gangrene.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.68,0:33:30.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}狗撕掉了你的耳朵 然后得了坏疽？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.40,0:33:31.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.40,0:33:31.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.40,0:33:34.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, look, we could sit and discuss this all day long but, erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.40,0:33:34.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们可以在这儿讨论一整天 但…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.32,0:33:36.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's not gonna bring her back, is it? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.32,0:33:36.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它也不会活过来了 对吧？ - 不会
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.32,0:33:37.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Dilwyn said that to be sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.32,0:33:37.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我们能找到…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.28,0:33:39.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}he wanted to do a post-mortem back at the yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.28,0:33:39.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}迪尔翁说 为了确认
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.28,0:33:47.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Which meant I had to convert my Range Rover into a hearse.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.28,0:33:42.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他想回院子里做一次尸检
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.56,0:33:45.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这意味着我得把我的路虎…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.24,0:33:46.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 上去 - …改造成灵车
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.76,0:33:49.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I won't pick it up myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.76,0:33:49.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我可不想自己动手搬它
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.44,0:33:51.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, I'll give you a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.44,0:33:51.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不 我帮你搭把手 - 你想把它荡进去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.96,0:33:55.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Please don't let the doctor see me doing all this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.96,0:33:55.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可别让医生看见我干这些破事
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.32,0:33:56.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All right, mind yourself, dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.32,0:33:56.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 小心 狗狗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.48,0:33:59.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}One...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.48,0:34:01.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一、二、三
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.28,0:34:00.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Two...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.00,0:34:02.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.84,0:34:03.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.84,0:34:03.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.92,0:34:07.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, shitting hell, that smells.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.92,0:34:08.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我靠 这味道 - 狗可喜欢了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.20,0:34:08.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The dog thinks it's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.48,0:34:10.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.48,0:34:10.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.12,0:34:16.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Cor, I'm glad I'm not in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.12,0:34:16.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谢天谢地我没坐那辆车
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.36,0:34:21.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Back at the yard, Dilwyn "Dexter" set to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.36,0:34:21.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}回到院子里后 迪尔翁德克斯特开始工作
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.08,0:34:23.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna chop here, getting the legs out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.08,0:34:23.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我先切开 把腿移开
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.72,0:34:27.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was gonna say I'll sit in the car, but that's worse in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.72,0:34:25.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我刚想说 你们干这个的时候 我坐车里等着
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.80,0:34:27.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}结果车里更难闻
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.32,0:34:29.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh, look at that. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.32,0:34:29.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 天哪 - 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.68,0:34:31.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, it's just rotten, innit?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.68,0:34:31.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}已经腐烂了 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.72,0:34:33.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What is? - The whole carcass is.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.72,0:34:33.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.00,0:34:35.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's the stomach, isn't it? The intestines.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.00,0:34:35.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}整个尸体都是 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.28,0:34:39.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's its fourth stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.28,0:34:37.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是胃 对吧？肠子
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.52,0:34:39.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是…那是它的第四个胃
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.68,0:34:42.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's its third one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.68,0:34:43.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是第三个 因为它们有四个胃
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.64,0:34:44.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause they've got four stomachs.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.40,0:34:47.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, we did say we'd show farming, warts and all on this show,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.40,0:34:47.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们确实说过 这个节目 会展示农场真实的一面 无论好坏
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.08,0:34:49.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but this is really stretching it this morning, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.08,0:34:49.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但今天早上这事是不是有点过了？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.80,0:34:52.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh Christ, now the faeces is all coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.80,0:34:52.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪 现在粪便都流出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.92,0:34:55.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I've made a hole in there. - It's shitting into its own stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.92,0:34:55.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗯 我从来没… - 它在往自己的胃里拉屎
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.84,0:34:57.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, for Christ's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.84,0:34:57.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.56,0:35:04.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't wanna come across as metropolitan here, but Dilwyn!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.56,0:35:04.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不想显得像个城里人 但是迪尔翁
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.76,0:35:07.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I've nicked its bowel! - What are you learning from this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.76,0:35:07.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我把它的肠子弄破了 - 你从这能看出什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.04,0:35:10.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, this is well dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.04,0:35:10.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 这个嘛 已经死了 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.24,0:35:18.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I wasn't expecting it to get up and run off.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.24,0:35:18.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我本来也没指望它会站起来跑掉
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.16,0:35:21.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'd like to apologise
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.16,0:35:21.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我谨代表
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.40,0:35:24.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}on behalf of the entire Clarkson's Farm team for this scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.40,0:35:24.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}《克拉克森的农场》全体团队 为这一幕向大家道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.64,0:35:27.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I promise
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.64,0:35:31.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我保证我们会尽量让气氛轻松起来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.68,0:35:28.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we will try to
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.68,0:35:31.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}lift the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.04,0:35:35.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sadly, however, this wasn't possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.04,0:35:35.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可惜 这一点目前还做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.96,0:35:40.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because over at the pub there'd been a problem with our bonfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.96,0:35:40.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为在酒吧那边 我们的篝火出了问题
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.44,0:35:45.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.44,0:35:45.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.36,0:35:50.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.36,0:35:50.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.28,0:35:53.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There was no time to worry about
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.28,0:35:53.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但没时间去追究
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.24,0:35:56.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which vandal was responsible for this, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.24,0:35:56.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}到底是哪个破坏分子干的了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.00,0:35:57.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Hi, guys. - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.00,0:35:57.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗨 各位 - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.96,0:36:00.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because with Bonfire Night looming,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.96,0:36:00.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为篝火之夜临近
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.76,0:36:04.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the pub team and I had to get cracking on the rebuild.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.76,0:36:04.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}酒吧团队和我必须 赶紧重新将其搭起来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.88,0:36:08.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Tip it forward a bit, a tad over. There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.88,0:36:08.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}往前倾一点 往这边挪 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.92,0:36:10.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you just put it down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.92,0:36:10.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你就把它放那儿就行
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.32,0:36:14.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mark? I need to get the straw to go in the middle...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.32,0:36:14.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}马克 我需要把稻草放中间
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.32,0:36:17.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which enables people to set fire to it when we're not looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.32,0:36:17.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样别人在我们 没注意的时候就能点着了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.16,0:36:20.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As we beavered away,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.16,0:36:20.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在我们忙碌之际
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.80,0:36:24.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Annie revealed the arson attack had been an inside job,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.80,0:36:24.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}安妮透露说 这次纵火是内部人员干的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.52,0:36:28.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}involving one of our own car-park attendants.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.52,0:36:28.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就是我们的一个停车场管理员
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.32,0:36:30.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He texted me and confessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.32,0:36:30.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他给我发了短信 承认了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.00,0:36:32.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The guy has confessed?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.00,0:36:33.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那家伙承认了？ - 对 他给我发了条消息
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.20,0:36:33.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, he sent me a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.96,0:36:36.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's just his final parting gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.96,0:36:36.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就当是他的离职告别礼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.00,0:36:39.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He had a couple of pints, on us, and then set fire to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.00,0:36:39.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他喝了几品脱 我们请的 然后把这个给点了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.36,0:36:40.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What? We gave him a couple of pints?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.36,0:36:40.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么？我们请他喝的酒？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.56,0:36:43.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think he went to the pub, he was drinking in the pub with his friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.56,0:36:43.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我想他去了酒吧 他和朋友在酒吧里喝酒
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.24,0:36:45.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then came down here, lit something in the woods,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.24,0:36:45.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后跑到这儿来 在树林里点了什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.64,0:36:47.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}walked through here and stood back and enjoyed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.64,0:36:47.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}穿过这里 然后站到后面欣赏起来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.36,0:36:49.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What did he light in the woods? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.36,0:36:49.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他在树林里点了什么东西？ - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.04,0:36:51.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can see on the CCTV he carries something from there into here,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.04,0:36:51.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}监控录像上能看到
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.04,0:36:55.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}chucks it in and then retreats.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.04,0:36:54.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他从那边拿了什么东西 走到这边
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.24,0:36:56.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}扔进去 然后走了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.16,0:37:00.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Did anyone get any footage of the fire? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.16,0:37:00.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有人拍到着火的画面了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.48,0:37:01.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Have you? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.48,0:37:01.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 有 - 你拍到了？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.52,0:37:03.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Really? Can I see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.52,0:37:02.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是的 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.64,0:37:03.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真的吗？我能看看吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.96,0:37:06.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh wow, look. Is that it? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.96,0:37:06.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 就是这个吗？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.16,0:37:09.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, so it's actually a very good fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.16,0:37:09.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以火确实烧得很旺
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.56,0:37:11.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}albeit 72 hours early.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.56,0:37:11.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}虽然早了72小时
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.56,0:37:13.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.56,0:37:13.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.16,0:37:14.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I hope he was pleased with himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.16,0:37:14.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我希望他自己挺满意的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.08,0:37:18.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Er, put it round the edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.08,0:37:18.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好 把它放在边上
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.16,0:37:20.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What, on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.16,0:37:20.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么？是这里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.80,0:37:26.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's walking past your butcher's shop when you can't eat meat,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.80,0:37:26.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你走过自己的肉铺 却不能吃肉
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.00,0:37:27.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, that is...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.00,0:37:27.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我是说 这真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.28,0:37:30.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've got a pub and a butcher's and you can't have anything from any of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.28,0:37:29.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你有一间酒吧和一家肉铺 却什么都吃不了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.52,0:37:30.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 也喝不了 - 对 一样都不行
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.92,0:37:33.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, either. I can't get high on my own supply, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.92,0:37:33.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不能吃自己的货 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.56,0:37:42.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As dusk fell, we'd broken the back of the rebuild.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.56,0:37:42.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}夜幕降临时 重建工作中 最艰巨的部分已经完成
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.32,0:37:46.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you know, that's better than the first one.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.32,0:37:46.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们知道吗？这比第一个还好
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.56,0:37:49.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. I didn't see the first one until it was burning, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.56,0:37:49.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊 不过在第一个烧起来前 我没见过它
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.24,0:37:55.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think we can be proud of that. It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.24,0:37:55.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得我们可以为此感到自豪
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.60,0:37:58.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Good, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.60,0:37:58.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}挺好的 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.56,0:38:00.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What are you having for dinner tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.56,0:38:00.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你今晚吃什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.16,0:38:03.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm, I haven't thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.16,0:38:03.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还没想过
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.40,0:38:07.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, it's just I've noticed there's a steak in your pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.40,0:38:08.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我就是注意到你口袋里 有一块牛排 然后…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.88,0:38:10.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.24,0:38:12.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All right, I've been shoplifting. I admit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.24,0:38:11.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 然后… - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.16,0:38:12.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我偷偷拿的 行了吧？我承认
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.12,0:38:15.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, well spotted.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.12,0:38:15.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 眼力不错 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.40,0:38:17.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is a good training course for you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.40,0:38:17.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这对各位来说 是个很好的培训课
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.68,0:38:19.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, I'll see you all tomorrow, then, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.68,0:38:19.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 那我们明天见 各位
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.72,0:38:23.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And thanks ever so much for this. It's brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.72,0:38:23.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}非常感谢你们来帮忙 这…太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.00,0:38:25.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Cheers. - Onwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.00,0:38:25.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 干杯 - 继续加油
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.24,0:38:26.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.24,0:38:26.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.80,0:38:32.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As the big day dawned, Charlie came back from his holiday
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.80,0:38:32.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在大日子来临之际 查理度完假回来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.20,0:38:36.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and immediately headed over for an urgent chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.20,0:38:36.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}立马赶过来讨论急事
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.32,0:38:40.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Not surprising given the cataclysmic event
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.32,0:38:40.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}考虑到他不在的这段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.68,0:38:43.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that had hit farming while he'd been away.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.68,0:38:43.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}农业界发生了一件灾难性事件 这也不奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.64,0:38:47.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The chancellor unveils one of the biggest ever
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.64,0:38:50.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}财政大臣公布了有史以来 增税幅度最大的预算案之一
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.80,0:38:50.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}tax-raising budgets in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.56,0:38:52.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}From 2026,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.56,0:38:52.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}从2026年起 农业资产超过…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.16,0:38:56.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}farmers whose agricultural assets are worth more than one million pounds
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.16,0:38:54.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（遗产税改革 超百万资产征20%的税）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.92,0:38:56.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…超过一百万英镑的农场主
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.56,0:38:59.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}will have to pay 20% Inheritance Tax.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.56,0:38:59.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}将需要缴纳百分之二十的遗产税
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.68,0:39:01.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Of course up until now farms had been exempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.68,0:39:00.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（农场主遗产税改革）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.80,0:39:01.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（停止家庭农场税）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.72,0:39:06.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This will ensure that we continue to protect small family farms,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.72,0:39:03.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当然 截至目前为止 农场是免税的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.36,0:39:06.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这会确保我们继续保护小型家庭农场
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.44,0:39:11.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with three quarters of claims unaffected by these changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.44,0:39:11.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}四分之三的农场补贴申领 不会受新政影响
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.68,0:39:20.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now... she's claiming-- 73% of farms won't be affected by the changes,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.68,0:39:18.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}她说只有七成…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.08,0:39:20.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}百分之七十三的农场 不会受这些变化影响
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.40,0:39:22.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which is nonsense. I mean, it's just not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.40,0:39:22.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这根本是胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.88,0:39:25.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yep. - And she's claiming
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.88,0:39:25.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我是说 这根本不是真的 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.48,0:39:28.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it's only a tiny bit. It isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.48,0:39:28.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}她还声称 这只是很小一部分… 根本不是
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.04,0:39:32.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Anyone whose land and assets are worth more than a million is hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.04,0:39:32.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}任何土地和资产价值 超过一百万的人都会受影响
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.32,0:39:35.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, well, if you've got a hundred acres in Huddersfield,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.32,0:39:35.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以…但如果 你在哈德斯菲尔德有一百英亩地
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.84,0:39:38.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}if you've a tractor and a combine harvester...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.84,0:39:38.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你有… 一台拖拉机和一台联合收割机
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.08,0:39:40.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So it's... - You're being clobbered.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.08,0:39:40.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你就会受到重创 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.04,0:39:43.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So page three of The Sunday Times, other papers are available,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.04,0:39:43.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}《星期日泰晤士报》第三版 其他报纸也有报道
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.28,0:39:45.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}some chap called Steven wrote about
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.28,0:39:45.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一个叫史蒂文的家伙写了一篇关于…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.76,0:39:50.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}a herd of cows that have been there for five generations,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.76,0:39:50.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一群奶牛…已经养了五代人了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.08,0:39:52.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}they're a dairy herd in Leicestershire farmed by the Eccleston family.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.08,0:39:52.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是莱斯特郡的一个奶牛群
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.24,0:39:55.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They've got six hundred cows.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.24,0:39:54.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}由埃克莱斯顿家族经营
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.12,0:39:55.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们有六百头牛
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.84,0:39:59.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Their six hundred cows alone take them over the threshold.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.84,0:39:59.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}光这六百头牛 就让他们的资产超过了门槛
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.84,0:40:01.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah, just the cows. - Just the cows.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.84,0:40:01.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 光是牛就超了 - 光是牛就超了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.88,0:40:03.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's not the dairy parlour.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.88,0:40:04.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那还没算上挤奶厅 也没算拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.60,0:40:04.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's not a tractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.92,0:40:06.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's not any of the implements.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.92,0:40:06.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没算任何农机 所有东西…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.88,0:40:08.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Everything... - Just the cows
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.88,0:40:08.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就牛本身 就让他们 超过了瑞秋里夫斯提的那条线
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.60,0:40:11.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}gets them over Rachel Reeves'... And she's sitting there,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.60,0:40:13.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而她还面不改色地坐在那里说
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.60,0:40:13.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with a straight face saying:
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.92,0:40:16.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Only 27% of farms are affected." It's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.92,0:40:16.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“只有百分之二十七的农场受影响”
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.68,0:40:21.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, but, I mean, if you have a rich person
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.68,0:40:18.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这不是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.76,0:40:21.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 但是… - 不 我的意思是 如果是一个
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.16,0:40:24.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}who's made a lot of money in investment banking and buys land
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.16,0:40:24.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在投行赚了很多钱的有钱人
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.36,0:40:27.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so that they don't have to pay Inheritance Tax, I can understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.36,0:40:27.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为了不用交遗产税而买下土地 那我能理解
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.64,0:40:29.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't agree with it, but I can understand
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.64,0:40:29.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不同意这种做法 但我能理解
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.20,0:40:31.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}why people would say that was unfair.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.20,0:40:31.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 为什么有人会说这不公平 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.60,0:40:33.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I get that. And I can see why Rachel Reeves
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.60,0:40:33.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我明白这一点 我也能理解为什么瑞秋里夫斯
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.68,0:40:35.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}would come after people like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.68,0:40:35.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}会针对这种人
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.48,0:40:38.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you know, the rich people who've bought land in the countryside, i.e. me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.48,0:40:38.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就是那些在乡下买地的 有钱人 也就是我
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.84,0:40:41.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. - But she's just got a blunderbuss
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.84,0:40:41.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 但是 怎么着？她就像端着
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.88,0:40:44.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and fired at, you know, the investment bankers,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.88,0:40:44.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一把大霰弹枪 朝着那些投行人士
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.48,0:40:46.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}or James Dyson, the hoover man with eight billion acres.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.48,0:40:46.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}或者詹姆斯戴森 那个拥有无数…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.56,0:40:52.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's aimed for him. But she's hit all the farmers.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.56,0:40:49.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他是吸尘器大王 有八十亿英亩的地
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.32,0:40:52.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}她瞄准的是他 结果打中的全是农民
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.68,0:40:54.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I haven't finished my bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.68,0:40:54.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的坏消息还没说完
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.40,0:40:55.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.60,0:40:57.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's the headline of the budget.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.60,0:40:57.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那只是预算案的大标题
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.76,0:40:59.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You read down into the budget,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.76,0:40:59.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你再往下看预算细则
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.44,0:41:02.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you're gonna have a carbon tax on your fertiliser.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.44,0:41:02.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你的肥料要征碳税了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.40,0:41:06.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}2027, she's gonna tax fertiliser.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.40,0:41:06.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}2027年 她要对肥料征税
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.16,0:41:09.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're gonna be paying between £50 and 75 per tonne
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.16,0:41:09.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们每吨肥料要缴纳50到75英镑的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.04,0:41:12.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}on fertiliser.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.04,0:41:12.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}税款
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.36,0:41:14.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But, you know, the strange thing is, when you import wheat
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.36,0:41:14.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但你知道 奇怪的是
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.12,0:41:19.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}from somewhere else it doesn't have all this on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.12,0:41:17.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当你从其他地方进口小麦时
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.44,0:41:19.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就没有这些税费
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.36,0:41:23.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know, it will be UK farmers will have these taxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.36,0:41:23.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道 这会…英国农民要交这些税
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.72,0:41:28.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So people like bakers will just say: "We can't afford to buy British wheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.72,0:41:26.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 人们…面包师傅就会说
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.12,0:41:28.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-“我们买不起英国小麦了 - 加拿大红小麦
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.32,0:41:30.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"We'll buy Canadian wheat where none of this applies."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.32,0:41:30.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“我们会买加拿大小麦 这些都不适用…”
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.16,0:41:31.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}None of this... yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.16,0:41:31.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些都没有…对
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.48,0:41:36.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then, Defra released a statement on the same afternoon
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.48,0:41:36.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 环境粮食与农村事务部 在同一天下午发布声明
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.88,0:41:39.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}saying that the 2025 basic payment
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.88,0:41:42.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}称2025年的基本补贴 将削减百分之七十六
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.76,0:41:41.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}would be cut by 76%.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.04,0:41:44.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're gonna get 24%.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.04,0:41:44.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你只能拿到百分之二十四 所以 明年…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.44,0:41:46.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So next year... - Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.44,0:41:49.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等等 基本补贴 本来应该是分阶段取消的…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.28,0:41:48.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The basic payments were supposed to be phased out over...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.08,0:41:50.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.08,0:41:50.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}三年时间
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.44,0:41:52.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She saved half a billion next year
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.44,0:41:55.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}光从农业这一块 她明年就节省了五亿英镑的现金流
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.48,0:41:55.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}from farming alone in cashflow.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.12,0:41:57.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It was... - Pick-up trucks,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.12,0:41:57.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这简直… - 皮卡
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.12,0:42:00.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}they've reclassified pick-up trucks as cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.12,0:42:00.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们把皮卡重新归类为小汽车了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.04,0:42:02.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So farmers using the L200s and Ford Rangers,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.04,0:42:02.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以农民用的是L200
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.00,0:42:03.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that's now a car so you've gotta pay proper tax on those.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.00,0:42:03.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 和福特游骑侠那些车 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.92,0:42:06.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And that hasn't been mentioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.92,0:42:06.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在算小汽车了 所以你得交足额的税
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.12,0:42:10.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna be a non-dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.12,0:42:08.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这一点根本没人提
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.28,0:42:10.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我要去当非本土纳税人了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.72,0:42:13.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If only I knew someone I could marry who was Irish.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.72,0:42:13.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}要是我认识能结婚的爱尔兰人就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.36,0:42:17.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, you can't even use your...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.36,0:42:17.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 你连你的…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.68,0:42:19.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That could cost you a lot more.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.68,0:42:19.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（剧组人员 那可能会让你花更多钱）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.92,0:42:30.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Meeting over, we headed to the pub
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.92,0:42:30.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}会议结束后 我们去了酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.44,0:42:32.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to get ready for the bonfire party.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.44,0:42:32.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为篝火晚会做准备
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.28,0:42:35.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And job one
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.28,0:42:38.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第一项任务是决定烧谁的肖像
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.28,0:42:39.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}was deciding whose effigy should be burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.68,0:42:43.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.68,0:42:43.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.32,0:42:46.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm Lord Elly and you have free spectacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.32,0:42:46.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我是阿里勋爵 你有免费眼镜
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.68,0:42:48.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}free suit, free tie...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.68,0:42:48.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}免费西装 免费领带
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.28,0:42:53.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and the opportunity to go for a little ride in a telehandler!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.28,0:42:53.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有机会在伸缩臂叉车上兜一小圈
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.04,0:42:54.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What do you think of that, Keir?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.04,0:42:54.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看啊 基尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.32,0:43:04.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, Keir. Just gonna lift you up by own testes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.32,0:43:04.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 基尔 就用你的蛋蛋把你吊起来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.32,0:43:07.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What do you think of that? Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.32,0:43:07.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你觉得怎么样？好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.32,0:43:18.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Once darkness fell,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.32,0:43:22.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}夜幕降临后 酒吧的院子里 开始挤满了当地居民
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.80,0:43:22.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the pub garden started to fill with the locals.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.20,0:43:26.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ladies and gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.20,0:43:26.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}女士们 先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.24,0:43:30.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Welcome to the first-ever Bonfire Night party at The Farmer's Dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.24,0:43:30.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}欢迎来到“农夫的狗” 首届篝火之夜派对
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.20,0:43:32.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got pulled-pork burgers
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.20,0:43:32.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们准备了 手撕猪肉汉堡配自制苹果酱
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.44,0:43:34.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with homemade apple sauce. We've got toffee apples.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.44,0:43:34.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有太妃糖苹果 并给孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.60,0:43:37.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And for the children, we have sausage sandwiches.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.60,0:43:37.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}准备了香肠三明治
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.56,0:43:41.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And everything, as is always the case at The Farmer's Dog,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.56,0:43:41.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所有东西 一如“农夫的狗”的一贯做法
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.68,0:43:44.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}was grown or reared
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.68,0:43:46.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}都是在英国 由英国农民种植或养殖的…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.16,0:43:46.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}in Britain by British farmers.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.88,0:43:49.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Before Rachel Reeves
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.88,0:43:51.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}也是在瑞秋里夫斯搞砸之前
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.16,0:43:51.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}f--s it up for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.32,0:43:52.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.32,0:43:52.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.72,0:43:55.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Before the traditional celebrations began, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.72,0:43:55.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过在传统的庆祝活动开始之前
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.96,0:43:58.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'd laid on an extra treat
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.96,0:44:00.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我安排了一个特别的助兴节目 无人机表演
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.20,0:44:00.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}in the shape of a drone show.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.96,0:44:03.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, ladies and gentlemen, hope you enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.96,0:44:03.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 女士们 先生们 希望大家喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.00,0:44:10.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.00,0:44:10.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么情况？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.92,0:44:13.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, Pepper!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.92,0:44:13.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}胡椒
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.40,0:44:14.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Pepper the cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.40,0:44:14.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“胡椒”牛牛
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.68,0:44:17.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, that's so clever!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.68,0:44:17.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.04,0:44:20.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's this going to be? What's it going to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.04,0:44:20.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这会变成什么？会变成什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.32,0:44:23.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh look, it's a sheep! - Maybe, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.32,0:44:23.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 看 是羊 - 羊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.84,0:44:25.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh wow, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.84,0:44:25.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看那个
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.92,0:44:28.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.96,0:44:31.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.96,0:44:31.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.40,0:44:35.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.40,0:44:35.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}猪
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.32,0:44:36.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Is it a pig? - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.32,0:44:36.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这是猪？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.92,0:44:38.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.92,0:44:38.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.72,0:44:45.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think there might be a crash on the A40 when they look up at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.72,0:44:44.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我敢打赌A40公路上肯定有人
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.08,0:44:45.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}会因为抬头看这个而撞车
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.36,0:44:48.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Combine! - It's a combine!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.36,0:44:48.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 联合收割机 - 联合收割机！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.56,0:44:50.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's Gerald's combine!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.56,0:44:50.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是联合收割机 - 是杰拉德的联合收割机
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.52,0:44:51.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.68,0:44:54.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's gorgeous!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.68,0:44:54.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.08,0:44:56.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The pump and the glass, innit?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.08,0:44:56.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}酒桶和酒杯 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.40,0:44:58.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, it's filling up! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.40,0:44:57.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（干杯）
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.32,0:44:58.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那…它在慢慢装满
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.36,0:45:01.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, what's it becoming?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.36,0:45:01.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它会变成什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.12,0:45:07.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Ah, Gerald! - It's Gerald!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.12,0:45:07.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是杰拉德！ - 杰拉德！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.64,0:45:12.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Look at that! - Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.64,0:45:12.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看啊！没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.04,0:45:14.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's your Christmas card sorted!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.04,0:45:14.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你的圣诞贺卡有着落了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.40,0:45:20.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Then the part I'd been looking forward to even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.40,0:45:20.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}接下来是我更期待的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.48,0:45:21.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.48,0:45:21.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.32,0:45:24.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We have smoke! We have fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.32,0:45:24.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有烟了 有火了！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.16,0:45:27.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at it go!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.16,0:45:27.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看它烧起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.20,0:45:29.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look, he's smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.20,0:45:29.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看 他在冒烟
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.36,0:45:32.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The guy is getting a warm posterior.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.36,0:45:32.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那家伙的屁股开始暖和了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.92,0:45:35.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}His suit has caught alight!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.92,0:45:35.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他的西装着火了！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.20,0:45:40.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}His hair is burning!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.20,0:45:40.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他的头发在烧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.76,0:45:42.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}His crotch is on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.76,0:45:42.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他的裤裆着火了！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.48,0:45:48.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That is one burning man.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.48,0:45:48.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是一个燃烧的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.08,0:46:02.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Given the strength of feelings round here post-budget,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.08,0:46:02.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}鉴于预算案之后 大家的情绪都很强烈
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.96,0:46:06.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it felt good to make fun of the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.96,0:46:06.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}拿政府开开玩笑感觉还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.28,0:46:15.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But all of us knew that to try and stop
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.28,0:46:15.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我们所有人都知道要阻止这场
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.80,0:46:19.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}this astonishing attack on British farming,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.80,0:46:20.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对英国农业的惊人攻击 光靠玩笑是不够的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.36,0:46:20.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}fun wouldn't cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.36,0:46:28.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And that soon, we'd have to get serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.36,0:46:28.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且很快 我们就得认真起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.04,0:46:40.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why do we farm? Why do we accept low prices?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.04,0:46:36.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（农民们！）
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.96,0:46:37.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（下集预告）
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.88,0:46:38.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（拯救英国农业）
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.80,0:46:40.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们为什么务农？为什么接受低价？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.48,0:46:41.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do the government even know where food comes from?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.48,0:46:41.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（只想养活你们）
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.40,0:46:44.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No !
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.40,0:46:43.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}政府到底知不知道食物从哪里来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.20,0:46:44.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.28,0:46:48.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When was the last time you played at a venue smaller than this?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.28,0:46:48.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们上次在比这还小的场地 演出是什么时候？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.16,0:46:51.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.16,0:46:51.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 ！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.44,0:46:53.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hold that far gate! Hold the far gate!
